---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const locale = 'en';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Kraal Code — Our Story and Purpose"
  description="Kraal Code is built by Chwezi Core Systems. Learn about our purpose, design philosophy, and commitment to African organisations."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalUrl="https://kraalcode.com/en/company/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section--warm">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Built by people who understand the problem</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-subtext">Kraal Code is a product of Chwezi Core Systems — built by a team that understands African operating realities because we live and work here.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container company-grid">
      <div class="company-image">
        <img src="/src/assets/images/about/about-team-strategy-meeting.jpg" alt="Business team in strategy meeting with financial documents" width="560" height="400" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="company-content">
        <h2>Our purpose</h2>
        <p>We believe that African organisations deserve enterprise-grade software that understands their reality — not systems designed for another market and forced to adapt.</p>
        <p>Kraal Code exists because we saw organisations outgrowing spreadsheets and accounting tools but unable to justify the cost, complexity, and cultural mismatch of imported ERP systems.</p>
        <p>Our design philosophy is simple: build for the person who will use the system every day. The warehouse supervisor checking stock on a tablet. The finance manager closing the month. The CEO checking cash flow from a phone while travelling. The field officer recording attendance.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section--dark section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Design principles</h2>
      <div class="principles-grid">
        <div class="principle-card">
          <h3>Usability is not optional</h3>
          <p>If someone needs a manual to do their job, we have failed. Every interface must teach itself. The 85% unassisted task success rate is not a target — it is a minimum.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-card">
          <h3>Security enables, not restricts</h3>
          <p>Good security makes remote work, delegation, and cloud access possible. It does not make the system harder to use. Controls must be invisible until they are needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-card">
          <h3>Local context matters</h3>
          <p>Uganda is not Kenya is not Tanzania. Tax rules, payroll statutory requirements, currency, and business practices differ. Localisation must be configuration, not code.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-card">
          <h3>Honest about what exists</h3>
          <p>We do not promise features that are not built. We do not claim certifications we do not have. If something is on the roadmap, we say so. If it is not right for you, we say that too.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>We are happy to answer questions about our product, our team, or our approach.</p>
      <a href="/en/contact/" class="btn btn--primary">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: var(--kc-space-20) 0 var(--kc-space-12);
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-4xl);
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .page-hero-subtext {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-lg);
    color: var(--kc-text-secondary);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-top: var(--kc-space-4);
  }

  .company-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--kc-space-12);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .company-image {
    border-radius: var(--kc-radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .company-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .company-content h2 {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--kc-space-4);
  }

  .principles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--kc-space-6);
  }

  .principle-card {
    padding: var(--kc-space-6);
    border: 1px solid var(--kc-border-dark);
    border-radius: var(--kc-radius-lg);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  }

  .principle-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--kc-font-body);
    font-size: var(--kc-text-lg);
    font-weight: var(--kc-weight-semibold);
    color: var(--kc-text-inverse);
    margin-bottom: var(--kc-space-3);
  }

  .principle-card p {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-sm);
    color: var(--kc-text-inverse-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--kc-space-4) var(--kc-space-8);
    font-weight: var(--kc-weight-semibold);
    font-size: var(--kc-text-base);
    border-radius: var(--kc-radius-lg);
    background: var(--kc-charcoal);
    color: var(--kc-text-inverse);
    transition: all var(--kc-transition-fast);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: var(--kc-space-6);
  }

  .btn:hover {
    background: var(--kc-teal-deep);
    color: var(--kc-text-inverse);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .company-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .principles-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .page-hero h1 { font-size: var(--kc-text-3xl); }
  }
</style>
